title: IainSchweblin0
---
Iain slowly rises from the floor. He wipes his eyes, looking around the room. As soon as he comes to, he grabs his head and pushes himself against the wall. With his back flat against the wall, he begins to hyperventilate. “Oh god, Oh god”

-> Create a strange noise that comes from down the hall
    The sudden noise grabs Iain’s attention and he begins to collect his thoughts. He takes a deep breath a continues down the hallway, hand on the wall.
-> Drop the temperature
    The sudden change grabs Iain’s attention and he begins to collect his thoughts. He takes a deep breath a continues down the hallway, hand on the wall.
-> Raise the lights
    <<reduce_fear "Iain Schweblin">>
    The sudden change grabs Iain’s attention and he begins to collect his thoughts. He takes a deep breath a continues down the hallway, hand on the wall.
-> Do nothing. Let his mind run in circles
    <<add_fear "Iain Schweblin">>
    He continues to hyperventilate. Eventually, he attempts to stand up, only to come crashing back to the floor. After several minutes, he tells himself he has to do something and starts to move down the hall.  
