title: IainSchweblin1
---
Iain was used to the silence of The Great Plains, but this place was different. There was an unnatural stillness that crept deep within him. He could hear the sound of his heart beating in his chest and his blood as it ran cold. 
->Let him stir in the silence
    The sound of his heart beating reminds him he's alive and in control.
->Create a dull sound from far off in the distance
    <<reduce_fear "Iain Schweblin">>
    He looks around him only to find nothing. The sound was innoculous enough. He's glad to know the world is still turning. 
->Fill his head with the sounds of people talking all around him
    <<add_fear "Iain Schweblin">>
    Iain grabs his head. This isolation is starting to get to him. The voices slowly dissipate, but a the feeling that he could be losing it lingers. 
->Create a sharp ringing noise
    Iain grabs his heead. "Where the hell is that coming from?" He walks further down the hall to investigate. 
===
title: IainSchweblin2
---
As the minutes turn to hours, his mind goes to Grace. Did someone do this to him because of her? Who would stalk his dead wife's grave site? Who would trap him in this kind of place?
->This place must be under the cemetery. Like some lost catacombs.
    <<reduce_fear "Iain Schweblin">>
    "Yeah! That could be it!" He feels a wave of hope. 
->Why would someone change the words on her gravestone?
    No use speculating. There is no way he can find answers by just standing around. 
->You didn’t appreciate her enough while she was alive. This is God punishing you.
    He remembers the way that she smiled at him whenever he walked in the door, and the way she gasped whenever he got her flowers. That can't be true. 
->Her soul has trapped you here. You failed to protect your wife when she needed you the most. You've been a neglectful father, careless with her children's childhoods. 
    <<add_fear "Iain Schweblin">>
    “I’m so sorry, Grace.” He holds back tears. 
===
title: IainSchweblin3
---
Iain thinks deeply about what happened before he blacked out, trying to find any answers. 
->"There was a storm coming, maybe you got hit by lightning and this is some sort of coma."
    Iain doesn't remember there being a storm going on. He shakes the thought from his mind. 
->"Someone else must have known you were coming to see Grace and captured you."
    "What would kidnapping me do?" He shakes the thought from his mind. 
->"Maybe you fell on the walk back and hit your head."
    "This feels too real." He shakes the thought from his mind. 
->"The kids are still in the car."
    <<add_fear "Iain Schweblin">>
    “Oh my god, THE KIDS” He goes into a frenzy. "What happened to the kids? Are they in here? Did someone notice that they were left there? How are they going to get back home?" He paces back and forth, sweating profusely.
===
