title: IainSchweblin5
---
A voice comes booming in from deeper in the maze. He can't make out what it's saying.
->"Hide"
    Iain tries to escape the approaching noise, but it suddenly goes silent. He looks back down the hallway and sees nothing. 
->"Run"
    Iain tries to escape the approaching noise, but it suddenly goes silent. He looks back down the hallway and sees nothing. 
->"Stand Still"
    Iain stands facing the approaching noise, but it suddenly goes silent. He looks down the hallway and sees nothing. 
->"There is nothing here. You're going crazy."
    <<add_fear "Iain Schweblin">>
    Iain stops for a moment, looking back at the noise. He shakes his head. "God, I'm really losing it" He continues walking with his shoulders tensed. 
